(6866126, 1034091, 138253, '<td valign="top">a children''s joke:<br/> <br/>Knock Knock.<br/>Who''s there.<br/>banana.<br/>banana who?<br/>knock knock.<br/>who''s there?<br/>banana.<br/>banana who?<br/>------some time later after repeating this same schtick----<br/>knock knock.<br/>who''s there?<br/>orange.<br/>orange who?<br/>orange you glad i didn''t say banana!</td>', 'a children''s joke: Knock Knock.Who''s there.banana.banana who?knock knock.who''s there?banana.banana who?------some time later after repeating this same schtick----knock knock.who''s there?orange.orange who?orange you glad i didn''t say banana!', '2012-09-19 13:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
