(6866131, 1033606, 138253, '<td valign="top">not quite sure i get the title.<br/>the image seems to be intentionally orange cast but in doing so there is some unpleasant looking edges around the shadows.<br/>this could be a much stronger image with some better lighting and processing.</td>', 'not quite sure i get the title.the image seems to be intentionally orange cast but in doing so there is some unpleasant looking edges around the shadows.this could be a much stronger image with some better lighting and processing.', '2012-09-19 13:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
