(6866153, 1033726, 138253, '<td valign="top">not a fan here... the selective desaturation would''ve had more impact if the actual banana was so out of focus and peel-colored. the lips are too shadowed and the focal point is slightly too far back, giving us a view usually reserved for the dentist.<br/>restoring a ruby-red colour to the lips would help bring attention there instead of past them to the in-focus area of the image.</td>', 'not a fan here... the selective desaturation would''ve had more impact if the actual banana was so out of focus and peel-colored. the lips are too shadowed and the focal point is slightly too far back, giving us a view usually reserved for the dentist.restoring a ruby-red colour to the lips would help bring attention there instead of past them to the in-focus area of the image.', '2012-09-19 13:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6866154, 1034096, 138253, '<td valign="top">eggcellent image.</td>', 'eggcellent image.', '2012-09-19 13:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6866156, 1034232, 138253, '<td valign="top">so that WAS just a banana in her underwear. Good! i was a bit worried for a while there ;P</td>', 'so that WAS just a banana in her underwear. Good! i was a bit worried for a while there ;P', '2012-09-19 13:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6866170, 1034285, 10785, '<td valign="top">Another fun portrait! This one differs from most of your other portrait processing in that your skin is reddish here and in your other work, your skin tends more toward a yellow color. I think the skin tone here is more natural comparatively. Good detail in the face but there is a softness around the edges of the frame that could be from shallow DoF.</td>', 'Another fun portrait! This one differs from most of your other portrait processing in that your skin is reddish here and in your other work, your skin tends more toward a yellow color. I think the skin tone here is more natural comparatively. Good detail in the face but there is a softness around the edges of the frame that could be from shallow DoF.', '2012-09-19 14:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6866171, 1034264, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the grain, the textured background and the nice long shadow. A minor critique would be to say that it is a little on the bright side, but you did get detail in the shadows and the highlights indicating a good exposure.</td>', 'I like the grain, the textured background and the nice long shadow. A minor critique would be to say that it is a little on the bright side, but you did get detail in the shadows and the highlights indicating a good exposure.', '2012-09-19 14:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6866173, 1034206, 10785, '<td valign="top">Solid attempt! I like how you controlled the specular highlight on the top-left edge of the front banana.</td>', 'Solid attempt! I like how you controlled the specular highlight on the top-left edge of the front banana.', '2012-09-19 14:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6866174, 1034202, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice use of small focal length to control the proportions of the subject. The hands and the bananas look gigantic compared to the head. A minor critique would be to point out the loss of detail in the highlights on the top surface of the bananas. Everywhere else has nice detail in the shadows/highlights.</td>', 'Nice use of small focal length to control the proportions of the subject. The hands and the bananas look gigantic compared to the head. A minor critique would be to point out the loss of detail in the highlights on the top surface of the bananas. Everywhere else has nice detail in the shadows/highlights.', '2012-09-19 14:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6866175, 1034250, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the glow!</td>', 'I like the glow!', '2012-09-19 14:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6866176, 1034209, 10785, '<td valign="top">This looks a little soft due to being handheld at slower shutter speed.</td>', 'This looks a little soft due to being handheld at slower shutter speed.', '2012-09-19 14:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6866179, 1034272, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice job controlling the light!</td>', 'Nice job controlling the light!', '2012-09-19 14:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6866265, 1033918, 10785, '<td valign="top">Definite issues related to focus or camera shake caused be hand held shot at slow shutter speed. Slight underexposure as well. But monkeys do love bananas!!</td>', 'Definite issues related to focus or camera shake caused be hand held shot at slow shutter speed. Slight underexposure as well. But monkeys do love bananas!!', '2012-09-19 16:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6866266, 1033812, 10785, '<td valign="top">There are some color issues here. The banana flesh looks green/yellow hued when it should really be that creamy white.</td>', 'There are some color issues here. The banana flesh looks green/yellow hued when it should really be that creamy white.', '2012-09-19 16:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6866267, 1033551, 10785, '<td valign="top">A little too much negative space here. Perhaps get closer to the subject.</td>', 'A little too much negative space here. Perhaps get closer to the subject.', '2012-09-19 16:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6866269, 1033726, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think you pushed the contrast and the saturation a little too much on this one. I am not liking the white part at the bottom right. The background would have been better as all dark tones.</td>', 'I think you pushed the contrast and the saturation a little too much on this one. I am not liking the white part at the bottom right. The background would have been better as all dark tones.', '2012-09-19 16:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6866305, 1034285, 108580, '<td valign="top">Medic! If I didn''t know any better I''d guess you attacked a banana republic? I didn''t hear the air raid sirens though...</td>', 'Medic! If I didn''t know any better I''d guess you attacked a banana republic? I didn''t hear the air raid sirens though...', '2012-09-19 19:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
