(6867042, 1034253, 108991, '<td valign="top">After rating 66 banana photos I am completely fed up with banana-humor. Here is one of the very few where the photo it self is worth the attention, rather than the "funny" idea... It''s a beautifully simple still live with a deceivingly simple compositin. The colours, light and softness all work together to get the feeling of a classical image. This one can hang on the walls for years, without becoming bored with it. Full marks!</td>', 'After rating 66 banana photos I am completely fed up with banana-humor. Here is one of the very few where the photo it self is worth the attention, rather than the "funny" idea... It''s a beautifully simple still live with a deceivingly simple compositin. The colours, light and softness all work together to get the feeling of a classical image. This one can hang on the walls for years, without becoming bored with it. Full marks!', '2012-09-21 06:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
