(6869634, 1034263, 135744, '<td valign="top">Well done and great execution! I have done one of these before and know how damn fiddly it is. I read that people use cocktail sticks to do it but when I tried this the slices just slipped so I used a metal kebab skewer - still a bit of a slippery experience though.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon!!</td>', 'Well done and great execution! I have done one of these before and know how damn fiddly it is. I read that people use cocktail sticks to do it but when I tried this the slices just slipped so I used a metal kebab skewer - still a bit of a slippery experience though. Congrats on the ribbon!!', '2012-09-26 03:08:02.000000', NULL, 0),
