(6869642, 1034241, 137576, '<td valign="top">5 x 1s <br/> <br/>9 x 2 <br/> <br/>12 x 3<br/> <br/>13 x 4<br/> <br/>I should have done a bland safe sliced banana shot, shame no one considered focus, lighting, composition but voted on personal believes. What''s happened to dpc when did it get so safe and conservative. They used to have nude challenges on here, I''m going to keep plugging away despite my score. <br/> <br/>Shame the haters are cowards as well, say if you don''t like it, stick your head above the parapet and let your disgust at a girl in a bra known. <br/> <br/>Ps picked this one as it was funny, made me laugh as its a bit cheeky <br/> <br/>This was from third shoot with my ex girlfriend who models for me :)</td>', '5 x 1s  9 x 2  12 x 3 13 x 4 I should have done a bland safe sliced banana shot, shame no one considered focus, lighting, composition but voted on personal believes. What''s happened to dpc when did it get so safe and conservative. They used to have nude challenges on here, I''m going to keep plugging away despite my score.  Shame the haters are cowards as well, say if you don''t like it, stick your head above the parapet and let your disgust at a girl in a bra known.  Ps picked this one as it was funny, made me laugh as its a bit cheeky  This was from third shoot with my ex girlfriend who models for me :)', '2012-09-26 03:34:57.000000', NULL, 0),
