(6869645, 1034241, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well I gave it a 10, but since you mentioned she was your EX girlfriend, I''m deducting 4 points - show me a pic of your new girlfriend and I might give them back. :P (kidding, I gave it a 6)<br/> <br/>If you want a real critique from me, here it is: Obviously I was not put off by the gratuitous skinnage - the lighting is excellent, but there is something off-putting about the angle or perspective. Also, a shallower dof or more distance from that bkg might have improved it. As for the challenge topic - I would guess more voters saw this as just a gratuitous shoehorn-ish entry. That''s my take on it, FWIW. Don''t let these results eat at ya - there is nothing you can do about it and you KNOW many have tried. :)</td>', 'Well I gave it a 10, but since you mentioned she was your EX girlfriend, I''m deducting 4 points - show me a pic of your new girlfriend and I might give them back. :P (kidding, I gave it a 6) If you want a real critique from me, here it is: Obviously I was not put off by the gratuitous skinnage - the lighting is excellent, but there is something off-putting about the angle or perspective. Also, a shallower dof or more distance from that bkg might have improved it. As for the challenge topic - I would guess more voters saw this as just a gratuitous shoehorn-ish entry. That''s my take on it, FWIW. Don''t let these results eat at ya - there is nothing you can do about it and you KNOW many have tried. :)', '2012-09-26 03:46:32.000000', NULL, 0),
