(6869890, 1034173, 112828, '<td valign="top">Not a bad start! <br/> <br/>I like where you''ve gone with this, and I think you''ve done a nice job with the overall strangeness of everything here.<br/> <br/>I think the photo could have benefitted from a few small tweaks, try playing around with these tools:<br/> <br/>Image &gt; Adjust &gt; Shadows Highlights<br/> <br/>Filters &gt; Sharpen &gt; Smart Sharpen (and Unsharp Mask)<br/> <br/>Image &gt; Adjust &gt; color balance</td>', 'Not a bad start!  I like where you''ve gone with this, and I think you''ve done a nice job with the overall strangeness of everything here. I think the photo could have benefitted from a few small tweaks, try playing around with these tools: Image > Adjust > Shadows Highlights Filters > Sharpen > Smart Sharpen (and Unsharp Mask) Image > Adjust > color balance', '2012-09-26 12:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
